    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mitchell Douglas are please to present a rare opportunity to acquire a detached 3 bed 1 bath home in one of Bray’s most established and sought-after enclaves. Positioned off Vevay Road, No. 20 Putland Villas combines prime central convenience with impressive long-range views toward Bray Head and Dalkey Island to the rear. Boasting a generous plot footprint, an oversized detached garage, and immediate access to top-tier amenities, this property represents an ideal project for buyers seeking a high-potential family residence or bespoke architectural redevelopment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\r\nLounge\r\nDiningroom\r\nKitchen\r\nBreakfast nook\r\n3 Bedrooms\r\nBathroom\r\nSeparate toilet"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tPrime Detached Position: Detached footprint providing side access, enhanced privacy, and significant scope for multi-directional\r\n        extension    (subject to relevant planning permission).\r\n•\tExceptional Scope & Potential: Features a large, versatile detached garage suited for immediate workspace/storage use or conversion \r\n        into a home office, gym, or self-contained studio unit.\r\n•\tPanoramic Rear Views: Elevational aspect captures unobstructed, sweeping vistas taking in Bray Head to the south and Dalkey Island \r\n        across the bay to the north.\r\n•\tUnbeatable Educational Infrastructure: Positioned directly adjacent to Presentation College Bray, offering door-to-door convenience \r\n        for primary and secondary schooling.\r\n•\tActive Lifestyle Amenities: Directly opposite Bray Lawn Tennis Club, with the Promenade, Bray Head Cliff Walk, and seafront all within \r\n        walking distance.\r\n•\tConnectivity: Strategic proximity to the N11/M50 corridor, regular Dublin Bus routes along Vevay Road, and quick access to Bray \r\n        DART Station."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: D"
      }
    ],
